0-33","title":"Mark 10:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>we go. Ac 20:22 and the Son. 8:31; 9:31; Mt 16:21; 17:22,23; 20:17-19; Lu 9:22; 18:31-33 Lu 24:6,7 condemn. 14:64; Mt 26:66; Ac 13:27; Jas 5:6 deliver. 15:1; Mt 27:2; Lu 23:1,2,21; Joh 18:28; 19:11; Ac 3:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-34","title":"Mark 10:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>mock. 14:65; 15:17-20,29-31; Ps 22:6-8,13; Isa 53:3; Mt 27:27-44 Lu 22:63-65; 23:11,35-39; Joh 19:2,3 spit. 14:63; Job 30:10; Isa 50:6; Mt 26:67 and the. Ps 16:10; Ho 6:2; Joh 1:17; 2:10; Mt 12:39,40; 1Co 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-35","title":"Mark 10:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>James.Matthew says that this request was made by Salome their mother; but though she made the request as from herself, yet it is evident that they had set her upon the business; and therefore Jesus, knowing whence it came, immediately addressed the sons.</p>\n<p>1:19,20; 5:37; 9:2; 14:33 come. Mt 20:20-28 we would. 2Sa 14:4-11; 1Ki 2:16,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-36","title":"Mark 10:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>What. 51; 1Ki 3:5-15; Joh 15:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-37","title":"Mark 10:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>sit. 16:19; 1Ki 22:19; Ps 45:9; 110:1 in. 8:38; Mt 25:31; Lu 24:26; 1Pe 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-38","title":"Mark 10:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Ye know not. 1Ki 2:22; Jer 45:5; Mt 20:21,22; Ro 8:26; Jas 4:3 drink of the. 14:36; Ps 75:8; Isa 51:22; Jer 25:15; Mt 26:39; Lu 22:42; Joh 18:11 baptized with the. Lu 12:50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-39","title":"Mark 10:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>We. 14:31; Joh 13:37 Ye. 14:36; Mt 10:25; Joh 15:20; 17:14; Ac 12:2; Col 1:24; Re 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-40","title":"Mark 10:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>Mt 20:23; 25:34; Joh 17:2,24; Heb 11:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-41","title":"Mark 10:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>they. 9:33-36; Pr 13:10; Mt 20:24; Lu 22:24; Ro 12:10; Php 2:3; Jas 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-42","title":"Mark 10:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>Ye know. Mt 20:25; Lu 22:25; 1Pe 5:3 are accounted. or, think good.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-43","title":"Mark 10:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>so. Joh 18:36; Ro 12:2 whosoever. 9:35; Mt 20:26,27; 23:8-12; Lu 9:48; 14:11; 18:14; Joh 13:13-18 1Co 9:19-23; Ga 5:13; 1Pe 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-45","title":"Mark 10:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>came. Mt 20:28; Lu 22:26,27; Joh 13:14; Php 2:5-8; Heb 5:8 and to. Isa 53:10-12; Da 9:24,26; 2Co 5:21; Ga 3:13; 1Ti 3:4-6; Tit 2:14 1Pe 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-46","title":"Mark 10:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>they came. Mt 20:29-34; Lu 18:35-43 as he went.Luke says that this took place \"as he was come nigh unto Jericho,\" and afterwards records an event which took place in that city. But the words [en to engizo autou eis lericho,] may be rendered, \"When he was nigh Jericho,\" which is equally true of him who is gone a little way from it, as of him who is come near it; and as it is probable that Jesus stayed some days in the neighbourhood, this might occur as he went out of the city during that time, and he might afterwards re-enter it.</p>\n<p>begging. Lu 16:20,22; Joh 9:8; Ac 3:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-47","title":"Mark 10:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>Jesus. Mt 2:23; 21:11; 26:71; Lu 4:16; 18:36,37; Joh 1:46; 7:41,52; 19:19 Ac 6:14 thou. Isa 9:6,7; 11:1; Jer 23:5,6; Mt 1:1; 9:27; 12:23; 15:22; 20:30; 21:9 Mt 22:42-45; Ac 13:22,23; Ro 1:3,4; Re 22:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-48","title":"Mark 10:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>many. 5:35; Mt 19:13; 20:31; Lu 18:39 but. 7:26-29; Ge 32:24-28; Jer 29:13; Mt 15:23-28; Lu 11:5-10; 18:1-8 Eph 6:18; Heb 5:7 have. Ps 62:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-49","title":"Mark 10:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>stood. Ps 86:15; 145:8; Mt 20:32-34; Lu 18:40; Heb 2:17; 4:15 Be. Joh 11:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-50","title":"Mark 10:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>Php 3:7-9; Heb 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-10-51","title":"Mark 10:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>What. 36; 2Ch 1:7; Mt 6:8; 7:7; Lu 18:41-43; Php 4